        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Lugano Airport, Bioggio, Lugano\n- Companies: Darwin Airline, Darwin Airline Group, Baboo, Adria Airways Switzerland\n- Topics: airport traffic, airline headquarters, airline acquisition, branding\n\nFacts:\n- Lugano Airport handles around 200,000 passengers each year and operates about 2,400 flights annually.\n- Darwin Airline has its headquarters at Lugano Airport.\n- Darwin Airline SA is a Swiss regional airline with its head office in Bioggio, Lugano, and it flies under the brand name Adria Airways Switzerland.\n- In November 2010, Darwin Airline Group from Lugano acquired Baboo and saved the company from bankruptcy.",
